# Design artefacts are source unless they are reproducible renders.
#
# The icon work kept every experiment (probe1–7, polarity, ablation, two-asset…)
# because each one documents a hypothesis that was measured and rejected — that is
# the reasoning behind the shipped icon, and it belongs in the repo. What does NOT
# belong is the rasterised output: every PNG under out/ is regenerated from the
# committed SVG masters by the scripts in tools/, and the ICO is repacked from
# those PNGs by generate-icon.js.
#
# So: commit sources, docs and the raw reference assets; ignore the renders.
out/
.tmp/
